<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.GetStaticPath(Start: vector, End: vector, Radius: number, Parameters: {any}): {any}`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`list llGetStaticPath(vector Start, vector End, float Radius, list Parameters);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a list of position vectors indicating pathfinding waypoints between positions at <b>start</b> and <b>end</b>, for a character of a given <b>radius</b>. The waypoints this function returns are for the 'static' nav mesh, meaning that objects set to "movable obstacle" or "movable phantom" are ignored.</p>
  <p>This function <b>can</b> be used from attachments and other non-character objects. It can also be used in any region, even if dynamic pathfinding is disabled.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>vector</span></td>
